</style></head><body>
<div class="app"><aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark">🌱</div><div><h1>CROPshield.AI</h1><small>Your farm. Your future.</small></div></div><div class="nav-label">YOUR FARM SPACE</div><nav class="nav" id="nav"><button class="active" data-page="home"><span class="ico">⌂</span>Overview</button><button data-page="profile"><span class="ico">♧</span>Farmer profile</button><button data-page="land"><span class="ico">⌖</span>Land & location</button><button data-page="crop"><span class="ico">♧</span>Crop & soil advisor</button><button data-page="schemes"><span class="ico">🏛</span>Schemes & support</button><button data-page="rescue"><span class="ico">✿</span>Crop rescue clinic</button><button data-page="planner"><span class="ico">▦</span>Daily crop planner</button><button data-page="weather"><span class="ico">☀</span>Weather & alerts</button><button data-page="journal"><span class="ico">▤</span>Farm success journal</button></nav><div class="side-note"><strong>🌾 A little care, every day</strong><p>Observe your crops regularly. Early action can help reduce avoidable losses.</p></div></aside>
<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center"><button class="btn outline small mobile-menu" onclick="document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button><div class="crumb">HaritMitra <span style="color:#9cad9f">/</span> <b id="crumb">Overview</b></div></div><div class="top-right"><span class="pill">🌿 Grow with confidence</span><div class="avatar" id="avatar">F</div></div></header><div class="content">
<section class="page active" id="page-home"><div class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#c6ef9c">SMART FARMING, ROOTED IN CARE</span><h2>Healthy crops.<br>Stronger harvests.</h2><p>One friendly place to understand your land, watch the weather, learn safer crop care, and keep track of every little win on your farm.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn light" onclick="showPage('crop')">Explore crop advisor ↗</button><button class="btn" style="background:#2b6545;border:1px solid #7ea88a" onclick="showPage('land')">Set up my farm</button></div></div></div>
<div class="grid stats"><div class="stat"><div><small>Farm profile</small><strong id="stat-land">Not set</strong><em>Complete your details →</em></div><div class="stat-icon">🗺️</div></div><div class="stat"><div><small>Active crop plans</small><strong id="stat-crops">0</strong><em>Keep every crop on track</em></div><div class="stat-icon">🌱</div></div><div class="stat"><div><small>Today's checklist</small><strong id="stat-tasks">0/3</strong><em>Small steps matter</em></div><div class="stat-icon">✓</div></div><div class="stat"><div><small>Farm journal</small><strong id="stat-photos">0</strong><em>Progress photos saved</em></div><div class="stat-icon">📸</div></div></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR DAILY BRIEFING</span><h2>Good morning, farmer <span id="hello-name">friend</span> 👋</h2><p>A simple overview of what to check on your farm today.</p></div><button class="btn outline small" onclick="showPage('planner')">Open daily plan →</button></div>
<div class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px"><h3>Today's field checklist</h3><span class="tag">DAILY CARE</span></div><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Walk through the field and look for unusual leaf spots</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Check soil moisture before watering</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Check the local weather before spraying or fertilising</label><div class="actions"><button class="btn small" onclick="updateTasks()">Save checklist</button></div></div><div class="card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><h3>Farm watch</h3><span class="tag orange">DEMO FEED</span></div><div class="news-item"><div class="news-dot">🌧️</div><div><b>Weather first, fieldwork second</b><p>Check an official local forecast before irrigation or spraying.</p></div></div><div class="news-item"><div class="news-dot">🐛</div><div><b>Scout before you spray</b><p>Identify the pest and check the crop-specific label before choosing a treatment.</p></div></div><div class="news-item"><div class="news-dot">📣</div><div><b>Local advisories matter</b><p>Use your state agriculture department or KVK for verified alerts.</p></div></div><button class="btn outline small" onclick="showPage('schemes')">Find support →</button></div></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR REAL FARM LIFE</span><h2>What would you like help with?</h2></div></div><div class="grid three-col"><div class="card"><div style="font-size:25px">🌿</div><h3>Choose crops wisely</h3><p>Record crops, soil, season and nutrient choices, then review them with evidence-based guidance.</p><button class="btn outline small" onclick="showPage('crop')">Open advisor →</button></div><div class="card"><div style="font-size:25px">🩺</div><h3>Spot crop trouble early</h3><p>Upload a photo to prepare a symptom report and next steps for an expert to verify.</p><button class="btn outline small" onclick="showPage('rescue')">Visit clinic →</button></div><div class="card"><div style="font-size:25px">📅</div><h3>Plan every day</h3><p>Build a simple crop-care routine and record what was actually done in the field.</p><button class="btn outline small" onclick="showPage('planner')">Make a plan →</button></div></div>
<div class="footer-note">HaritMitra is a demonstration prototype. Weather, news, AI diagnosis, alerts and government-scheme feeds are not connected to live services in this HTML-only version. Verify agronomic decisions with a Krishi Vigyan Kendra (KVK), state agriculture officer, or the product label.</div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-profile"><span class="eyebrow">GETTING TO KNOW YOU</span><h2 class="page-title">Farmer profile</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Your details help personalise the experience. Use a password only after connecting this page to a secure backend.</p><div class="card"><form id="profile-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Farmer name</label><input id="farmer-name" placeholder="e.g. Savita Patil" required></div><div class="field"><label>Email address</label><input id="farmer-email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></div><div class="field"><label>Password (demo only)</label><input id="farmer-password" type="password" placeholder="Use secure sign-in in production"><small>This prototype does not save or authenticate passwords. Never enter a real password here.</small></div><div class="field"><label>Preferred language</label><select id="language"></select><small>India has 22 constitutionally scheduled languages; this list includes them plus English. Interface translations need to be added separately.</small></div><div class="field"><label>Phone (optional)</label><input id="farmer-phone" type="tel" placeholder="For future SMS alerts"></div><div class="field"><label>Farming experience</label><select><option>Choose experience</option><option>Just starting</option><option>1–5 years</option><option>6–15 years</option><option>15+ years</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button type="submit" class="btn">Save profile</button><button type="button" class="btn outline" onclick="showPage('land')">Next: land details →</button></div></form></div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-land"><span class="eyebrow">WHERE YOUR HARVEST BEGINS</span><h2 class="page-title">Land & location</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Set the area and location of your farm to help organise local advisories.</p><div class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><h3>Land details</h3><form id="land-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Land area</label><input id="land-area" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" placeholder="e.g. 2.5" required></div><div class="field"><label>Unit</label><select id="land-unit"><option>Acres</option><option>Hectares</option><option>Guntha</option><option>Bigha (varies by region)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>State / Union Territory</label><select id="state-select" required></select></div><div class="field"><label>District</label><select id="district-select"><option value="">Choose state first</option></select><small>District options are populated for Maharashtra in this demo. Other states need an official district directory/API connection.</small></div><div class="field full"><label>Village / nearest town</label><input id="village" placeholder="Village, taluka or nearest town"></div><div class="field full"><label>Exact GPS location</label><input id="gps" placeholder="Tap the location button to use device GPS" readonly></div></div><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="btn" onclick="getGPS()">⌖ Use my GPS location</button><button type="submit" class="btn outline">Save land details</button></div><div class="hint">⌖ GPS works only when your browser grants permission and the page is served over HTTPS or localhost. You can also type coordinates from your maps app.</div></form></div><div class="card"><h3>Location snapshot</h3><div style="height:180px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e4f0d7,#c4dfb6);display:grid;place-items:center;text-align:center;padding:20px"><div><div style="font-size:42px">📍</div><b id="location-label">Your farm will appear here</b><p style="margin:6px 0">GPS coordinates are kept in this page only.</p></div></div><div class="risk"><span class="circle green-dot"></span><div><strong>Why location matters</strong><p>Local rainfall, soil conditions and pest advisories can vary even between nearby areas.</p></div></div><div class="risk"><span class="circle yellow-dot"></span><div><strong>Privacy reminder</strong><p>Only share precise farm coordinates with services you trust.</p></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-crop"><span class="eyebrow">FIELD-WISE DECISIONS</span><h2 class="page-title">Crop & soil advisor</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Record what you grow and review choices before investing in seed, water or nutrients.</p><div class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><h3>Your current crop setup</h3><form id="crop-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Crop</label><select id="crop-name"><option value="Rice">Rice (Oryza sativa)</option><option value="Wheat">Wheat (Triticum aestivum)</option><option value="Cotton">Cotton (Gossypium hirsutum)</option><option value="Soybean">Soybean (Glycine max)</option><option value="Tomato">Tomato (Solanum lycopersicum)</option><option value="Onion">Onion (Allium cepa)</option><option value="Chickpea">Chickpea (Cicer arietinum)</option><option value="Maize">Maize (Zea mays)</option><option value="Sugarcane">Sugarcane (Saccharum officinarum)</option><option value="Groundnut">Groundnut (Arachis hypogaea)</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Season</label><select id="crop-season"><option>Kharif (monsoon)</option><option>Rabi (winter)</option><option>Zaid (summer)</option><option>Year-round / perennial</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Soil type (if known)</label><select id="soil-type"><option>Not sure</option><option>Black soil</option><option>Alluvial soil</option><option>Red soil</option><option>Laterite soil</option><option>Sandy soil</option><option>Clay / heavy soil</option><option>Loamy soil</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Water source</label><select><option>Rain-fed</option><option>Well / borewell</option><option>Canal</option><option>Drip irrigation</option><option>Mixed sources</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Fertiliser currently used</label><select id="fert-type"><option>Not sure yet</option><option>Compost / farmyard manure</option><option>Vermicompost</option><option>Urea</option><option>DAP</option><option>NPK mixture</option><option>Organic + chemical</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Growth stage</label><select><option>Before sowing</option><option>Seedling / emergence</option><option>Vegetative growth</option><option>Flowering</option><option>Fruit / grain development</option><option>Near harvest</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>What is your main concern?</label><textarea id="crop-concern" rows="2" placeholder="e.g. yellow leaves, low growth, water shortage, high input costs"></textarea></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">Review my choices ✦</button><button class="btn outline" type="button" onclick="addCropPlan()">Add to crop plans</button></div></form></div><div class="card"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center"><h3>Choice review</h3><span class="tag orange">RULE-BASED DEMO</span></div><p>This page uses general prompts, not a trained AI model or soil test. Final suitability depends on local variety, sowing date, soil test, irrigation and official recommendations.</p><div id="crop-review"><div class="risk"><span class="circle yellow-dot"></span><div><strong>Start with local evidence</strong><p>Select your crop and details, then review the checklist.</p></div></div></div><div class="hint warning">Do not apply fertiliser or pesticide solely from this demo. Correct amounts depend on crop, growth stage, soil test and product concentration.</div></div></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">REFERENCE TABLE</span><h2>Crop options to discuss with your local advisor</h2><p>Indicative season and nutrient information; not a guaranteed yield ranking.</p></div></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Crop (scientific name)</th><th>Common season*</th><th>Soil / water note</th><th>Nutrient options (scientific / common name)</th><th>Important check</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Rice — <i>Oryza sativa</i></td><td>Kharif; also irrigated seasons</td><td>Water availability and field drainage are critical</td><td>Compost / farmyard manure; urea (CO(NH₂)₂); DAP [diammonium phosphate, (NH₄)₂HPO₄] where advised</td><td>Use soil-test-based NPK schedule</td></tr><tr><td>Wheat — <i>Triticum aestivum</i></td><td>Rabi</td><td>Cool growing period; timely irrigation</td><td>Compost; urea; DAP or SSP [single superphosphate] if recommended</td><td>Match nitrogen timing to local package of practices</td></tr><tr><td>Soybean — <i>Glycine max</i></td><td>Kharif</td><td>Well-drained soil; avoid waterlogging</td><td>Compost; phosphorus and potassium sources per soil test; rhizobium inoculant where recommended</td><td>Use crop-specific seed treatment advice</td></tr><tr><td>Chickpea — <i>Cicer arietinum</i></td><td>Rabi</td><td>Usually prefers well-drained soil</td><td>Compost; phosphorus source based on soil test; biofertiliser inoculant if locally recommended</td><td>Avoid excess nitrogen without advice</td></tr><tr><td>Cotton — <i>Gossypium hirsutum</i></td><td>Mostly Kharif</td><td>Long season; monitor moisture and pests</td><td>Farmyard manure; urea; NPK based on soil test and local recommendations</td><td>Use integrated pest management and scout regularly</td></tr><tr><td>Tomato — <i>Solanum lycopersicum</i></td><td>Varies by region and irrigation</td><td>Drainage, disease pressure and market timing matter</td><td>Compost; NPK plan based on soil and crop stage</td><td>Confirm variety and local planting window</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="footer-note">*Season windows vary by state, altitude, irrigation and cultivar. Nutrient product names above are examples, not application rates. Obtain a soil test and consult the state agricultural university/KVK package of practices.</p></section>

<section class="page" id="page-schemes"><span class="eyebrow">HELP THAT REACHES THE FIELD</span><h2 class="page-title">Government schemes & support</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">A starting point for finding trusted guidance, weather alerts, crop-protection training and affordable services.</p><div class="hint warning">Scheme eligibility, application windows and benefits change. This prototype does not check eligibility or live application status. Use official portals only; never pay an agent for a guaranteed benefit.</div><div class="grid three-col"><div class="card"><span class="tag">INCOME SUPPORT</span><h3>PM-KISAN</h3><p>Central income-support scheme for eligible farmer families, subject to current rules and exclusions.</p><a href="https://pmkisan.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn small" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">Official portal ↗</a></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">CROP INSURANCE</span><h3>Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana</h3><p>Explore notified crop insurance, enrolment timelines and claim-related information.</p><a href="https://pmfby.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn small" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">Official portal ↗</a></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">MARKET INFO</span><h3>e-NAM</h3><p>Learn about an electronic agricultural market platform and participating mandis.</p><a href="https://enam.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn small" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">Official portal ↗</a></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">LOCAL EXPERTS</span><h3>Krishi Vigyan Kendra (KVK)</h3><p>KVKs offer location-specific agricultural training, demonstrations and advisory support.</p><a href="https://kvk.icar.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn small" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">Find a KVK ↗</a></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">WEATHER</span><h3>IMD Agromet advisories</h3><p>Check official weather forecasts and district-level agrometeorological advisories.</p><a href="https://mausam.imd.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn small" style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none">IMD portal ↗</a></div><div class="card"><span class="tag">STATE SUPPORT</span><h3>State agriculture office</h3><p>Ask about current state schemes, soil testing, subsidised inputs and pest surveillance.</p><button class="btn outline small" onclick="showPage('land')">Set state & district</button></div></div><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BUY</span><h2>Affordable crop-protection checklist</h2></div></div><div class="card"><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox"> Identify the pest or disease before choosing a product.</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox"> Ask the KVK/agriculture officer about integrated pest management (IPM) and non-chemical controls.</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox"> Compare registered products by active ingredient, concentration, pack size and total cost.</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox"> Check that the product is registered for this crop and target pest, and follow the label exactly.</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox"> Use required protective equipment and observe re-entry and pre-harvest intervals.</label></div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-rescue"><span class="eyebrow">EARLY OBSERVATION, BETTER DECISIONS</span><h2 class="page-title">Crop rescue clinic</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Upload a clear photo and record symptoms. This page prepares a report; it cannot diagnose a disease or estimate crop survival with reliability without a real, validated model and expert review.</p><div class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><h3>1. Tell us what you see</h3><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Crop</label><select id="rescue-crop"><option>Rice</option><option>Wheat</option><option>Cotton</option><option>Soybean</option><option>Tomato</option><option>Onion</option><option>Chickpea</option><option>Maize</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>When did it start?</label><select><option>Today</option><option>2–3 days ago</option><option>About a week ago</option><option>More than a week ago</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>Symptoms noticed</label><select id="symptom"><option>Yellowing leaves</option><option>Spots or patches on leaves</option><option>Holes / chewing damage</option><option>Wilting or drooping</option><option>Stem or root damage</option><option>Fruit / grain damage</option><option>White powder / mould-like growth</option><option>Unknown / mixed symptoms</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>Recent rain, irrigation or spray (optional)</label><textarea rows="2" placeholder="Add details that could help an expert"></textarea></div></div><div class="upload" style="margin-top:15px"><div style="font-size:30px">📷</div><b>Upload crop photos</b><p>Include the whole plant, close-up of affected area and a healthy comparison if possible.</p><input type="file" id="crop-photos" accept="image/*" multiple></div><div id="photo-preview" class="preview"></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" onclick="prepareReport()">Prepare symptom report</button></div></div><div class="card"><h3>2. Field response report</h3><div id="rescue-report"><div class="empty"><div style="font-size:35px">🩺</div><b>Your report will appear here</b><p>Upload photos and describe symptoms to prepare a checklist for expert verification.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SAFER RESPONSE</span><h2>What to do while you verify</h2></div></div><div class="grid three-col"><div class="card"><div style="font-size:24px">🔎</div><h3>Observe and record</h3><p>Photograph both sides of leaves, stems, roots if practical, and the wider field pattern. Note how quickly symptoms spread.</p></div><div class="card"><div style="font-size:24px">🚫</div><h3>Don't guess and spray</h3><p>Several diseases, nutrient problems and water stress look similar. Avoid mixing products or using unlabelled remedies.</p></div><div class="card"><div style="font-size:24px">🧤</div><h3>Protect people and pollinators</h3><p>Follow label PPE, drift precautions, pollinator warnings, re-entry time and harvest interval. Keep children and animals away.</p></div></div><div class="hint warning">No survival percentage, pesticide amount, or spray schedule is generated here because that would be misleading without verified diagnosis, crop stage, product label and local guidance.</div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-planner"><span class="eyebrow">A ROUTINE THAT FITS YOUR FIELD</span><h2 class="page-title">Daily crop planner</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Create a separate care plan for each crop, then tick off daily observations and tasks.</p><div class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><h3>Add a crop plan</h3><form id="plan-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Crop name</label><input id="plan-crop" placeholder="e.g. Soybean" required></div><div class="field"><label>Sowing date</label><input id="plan-date" type="date"></div><div class="field"><label>Season</label><select id="plan-season"><option>Kharif</option><option>Rabi</option><option>Zaid</option><option>Perennial</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Expected crop duration (days)</label><input id="plan-duration" type="number" min="1" placeholder="e.g. 100"></div><div class="field full"><label>Today's task</label><input id="plan-task" placeholder="e.g. check soil moisture, inspect leaves"></div><div class="field"><label>Reminder time</label><input id="plan-time" type="time" value="07:00"></div><div class="field"><label>Reminder frequency</label><select id="plan-frequency"><option>Daily</option><option>Weekly</option><option>One-time</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">Add crop plan</button><button type="button" class="btn outline" onclick="enableNotifications()">Enable browser notifications</button></div></form><div class="hint">Browser notifications require permission and an active browser session. This static website cannot guarantee alarms while closed. For reliable reminders, a mobile app or server notification service is needed.</div></div><div class="card"><h3>My active crop plans</h3><div id="plan-list"><div class="empty">No crop plans yet. Add your first crop on the left.</div></div></div></div><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SIMPLE DAILY LOG</span><h2>Field tasks</h2><p>Use this checklist for observations, not automatic pesticide instructions.</p></div></div><div class="card"><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Check soil moisture and water only if needed</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Inspect a few plants from different parts of the field</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Look for beneficial insects and new pest symptoms</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Review weather and any official local advisory</label><label class="checkrow"><input type="checkbox" class="task-check"> Record work done, inputs used and unusual changes</label><button class="btn small" style="margin-top:15px" onclick="updateTasks()">Save today's progress</button></div><div class="footer-note">Water and nutrient amounts must be crop-, soil-, stage- and weather-specific. Pesticide timing and dose must come from the registered product label and official crop advisory—not a generic day-by-day schedule.</div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-weather"><span class="eyebrow">PLAN AROUND THE SKY</span><h2 class="page-title">Weather & field alerts</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Weather affects irrigation, sowing, spraying and harvest. Live 30-day forecasts require a weather API and location permission.</p><div class="weather-big"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#c9f0b5">YOUR LOCAL FORECAST</span><h3 id="weather-place" style="font:700 21px Manrope;margin:10px 0">Set your farm location</h3><p>Demo view — not a live forecast</p><div class="weather-temp">--°</div><p>Connect an official forecast to show actual conditions.</p></div><div class="weather-icon">🌤️</div></div><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">NEXT 7 DAYS</span><h2>Forecast preview</h2><p>Illustrative placeholders only; do not use for field decisions.</p></div><button class="btn outline small" onclick="window.open('https://mausam.imd.gov.in/','_blank')">Open IMD ↗</button></div><div class="forecast" id="forecast"></div><div class="grid two-col" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="card"><h3>Weather-smart safety</h3><div class="risk"><span class="circle green-dot"></span><div><strong>Before irrigation</strong><p>Check soil moisture, crop stage, recent rainfall and drainage.</p></div></div><div class="risk"><span class="circle orange-dot"></span><div><strong>Before spraying</strong><p>Check label restrictions and official wind/rain advice. Avoid drift and protect nearby people, water and pollinators.</p></div></div><div class="risk"><span class="circle yellow-dot"></span><div><strong>Before heavy rain or heat</strong><p>Use IMD and district advisories to plan field work and protect stored inputs and equipment.</p></div></div></div><div class="card"><h3>Verified sources</h3><div class="news-item"><div class="news-dot">🌦️</div><div><b>India Meteorological Department</b><p>Official forecasts and warnings.</p><a href="https://mausam.imd.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mausam.imd.gov.in ↗</a></div></div><div class="news-item"><div class="news-dot">🌾</div><div><b>Agromet advisory services</b><p>District and crop-related weather advice where available.</p><a href="https://agromet.imd.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">agromet.imd.gov.in ↗</a></div></div><div class="news-item"><div class="news-dot">🏛️</div><div><b>Local agriculture department</b><p>For district-specific pest alerts and action thresholds.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="hint warning">A static HTML file cannot fetch reliable 30-day local weather by itself. A production version needs an API, location consent, a backend key where required, and clear timestamps/source labels.</div></section>

<section class="page" id="page-journal"><span class="eyebrow">EVERY HARVEST HAS A STORY</span><h2 class="page-title">Farm success journal</h2><p style="color:var(--muted)">Record before-and-after photos, actions taken and the results you observe. Your journal stays in this page while it is open.</p><div class="grid two-col"><div class="card"><h3>Add a farm update</h3><form id="journal-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Date</label><input id="journal-date" type="date" required></div><div class="field"><label>Crop</label><input id="journal-crop" placeholder="e.g. Tomato" required></div><div class="field"><label>Update type</label><select id="journal-type"><option>Before treatment / baseline</option><option>Daily progress</option><option>After treatment / follow-up</option><option>Harvest result</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Crop condition</label><select id="journal-condition"><option>Healthy</option><option>Improving</option><option>No visible change</option><option>Worsening</option><option>Harvested</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>What changed? What did you do?</label><textarea id="journal-notes" rows="3" placeholder="Describe symptoms, weather, care and outcome"></textarea></div><div class="field full"><label>Attach photos</label><input id="journal-photos" type="file" accept="image/*" multiple></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="submit">Save farm update</button></div></form></div><div class="card"><h3>Your progress snapshot</h3><div class="grid three-col" style="gap:8px"><div style="padding:13px;background:#f2f7ef;border-radius:12px"><small>Entries</small><h2 id="journal-count">0</h2></div><div style="padding:13px;background:#f2f7ef;border-radius:12px"><small>Improving</small><h2 id="journal-improving">0</h2></div><div style="padding:13px;background:#f2f7ef;border-radius:12px"><small>Harvested</small><h2 id="journal-harvested">0</h2></div></div><p>Use comparable photos, similar angles and notes about weather and care to make progress easier to assess.</p><div class="hint">The journal is not backed up. Refreshing the page may clear entries. Add secure storage before using this for real farm records.</div></div></div><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FARM STORY</span><h2>Recent updates</h2></div></div><div class="grid three-col" id="journal-list"><div class="card empty">Your saved updates will appear here.</div></div></section>
